        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana FP238, Solid Brass Round Cup Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Deltana made FP238 2-3/8 Inch Diameter Round Flush Pull is easy to install with (2) simple brad nails to hold the piece in place. It is made from high quality solid brass and is available in 11 finishes (click picture to the right to see them all). This round cup pull is great for light-weight doors and sliding doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-FP238-Specifications.gif?v=1704354507\" width=\"530\" height=\"217\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana FP238 Round Flush Door Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/1-7-8-inch-round-flush-pull-deltana-fp178\">Deltana 1-7/8\" Round Flush Pull</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana FP238 Round Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 11/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Diameter: 2-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3/32\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-FP238-specifications.pdf?v=1704262322\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana FP238 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</a></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
