                "title": "2-3/8 Inch Diameter Round Flush Pull | Deltana FP238",
                "description": "Deltana FP238, 2-3/8 Inch Diameter Round Flush Pull - The Deltana made FP238 2-3/8 Inch Diameter Round Flush Pull is easy to install with a simple brad nail to hold the piece in place. It is made from high quality solid brass and is available in 11 finishes. This round cup pull is great for light-weight doors and sliding doors.",
